# M45 Execution Changes Log — Circular Button Pattern, Tooltips, Spacing & Nightly Notifications

Autonomous sprint following the strict TDD loop per task: failing tests →
implementation → targeted tests → backlog check-off → git commit, followed by a
full `fvm flutter analyze` and full `fvm flutter test`. Verification used the
project's pinned FVM SDK (Flutter 3.29.0).

## Task 1: Circular Icon Button Component
- `lib/ui/atoms/circular_icon_button.dart` — reusable circular button: a clear
  graphic glyph in a generously padded 56 dp circular hit target
  (`minimumSize`/`defaultSize` 56, `defaultPadding` 16), a long-press `Tooltip`
  (`TooltipTriggerMode.longPress`) explaining its exact function, and full
  `Semantics` (button/enabled/selected/label).
- `lib/ui/molecules/circular_icon_button_group.dart` — spaced `Wrap`
  (`defaultSpacing` 20) so option clusters never collapse into an elongated
  pill strip.
- Tests: `test/ui/circular_icon_button_test.dart` (icon render, long-press
  tooltip, tap callback, padding/min-size, selected + disabled semantics, group
  spacing).

## Task 2: Calendar & Symptom View Refactor
- New symptom domain: `lib/core/models/symptom_log.dart` (`SymptomType`:
  pain / discomfort / energy / stress; `SymptomLog` with `0..3` severity),
  `lib/core/data/symptom_repository.dart`,
  `lib/core/data/local_symptom_repository.dart`,
  `lib/core/mocks/mock_symptom_repository.dart`, and
  `lib/core/state/symptom_controller.dart` (load / levelOf / setLevel / cycle /
  hasAnyLogged, persists every mutation).
- SQLite schema `11 → 12`: `symptom_logs(id, date, symptom, level,
  UNIQUE(date, symptom))` plus `getSymptomLogs` / `getAllSymptomLogs` /
  `upsertSymptomLog`; created in `_onCreate` and the `oldVersion < 12` upgrade.
- `lib/ui/molecules/symptom_tracker.dart` — the spaced-out circular symptom
  view: one `CircularIconButton` per symptom (healing / accessibility / bolt /
  self-improvement glyphs), tap cycles severity, long-press tooltip, and a
  localized severity readout.
- Calendar refactor: `schedule_page.dart` month navigation and
  `calendar_history_dialog.dart` month navigation now use `CircularIconButton`
  (stable keys preserved), and the Schedule tab mounts the `SymptomTracker`.
- i18n: added `previousMonthTooltip`, `nextMonthTooltip`, `symptomTrackerTitle`,
  `symptomTrackerSubtitle`, `symptomNoneLogged`, `symptomLabel`,
  `symptomTooltip`, `symptomLevel` to `AppStrings` + English/Spanish
  dictionaries; the full-coverage probe now renders them.
- Wiring: `app.dart` builds the shared `SymptomController` (SQLite or mock) and
  `MainShellPage` forwards it to the Schedule tab.
- Tests: `test/models/symptom_log_test.dart`,
  `test/data/local_symptom_repository_test.dart`,
  `test/state/symptom_controller_test.dart`, `test/ui/symptom_tracker_test.dart`,
  `test/features/m45_calendar_symptoms_widget_test.dart`; existing
  `m13_schedule_widget_test.dart` and `i18n/full_coverage_test.dart` still green.

## Task 3: Nightly Scheduled Notifications
- `lib/core/services/notification_service.dart` — new evening check-in at
  **20:30** (`nightlyCheckInId` 3301) that prompts only for the logs still
  missing today: symptoms (`SymptomRepository`) and/or activity
  (`DailyEntryRepository`). When both are already recorded it cancels any
  pending check-in instead of scheduling one.
- Rich formatting: `BigTextStyleInformation` + `AndroidNotificationCategory
  .reminder` + two icon actions (`symptom_check_in` → "Log symptoms",
  `activity_check_in` → "Log activity") using
  `DrawableResourceAndroidBitmap`, both `showsUserInterface: true`.
- Android resources added: `drawable/ic_checkin_symptom.xml`,
  `drawable/ic_checkin_activity.xml`, `drawable/ic_notification.xml`.
- Routing: `NotificationNavigationController.requestSymptoms()` +
  `NotificationAction.openSymptoms`; `app.dart` routes the symptom action and
  `MainShellPage` switches to the Schedule tab (index 2). The background handler
  recognises both action ids and clears the notification.
- Tests: `test/services/notification_nightly_check_in_test.dart` (20:30
  schedule, icon actions, big-text style, cancel-before-reschedule, skip when
  both logged, symptoms-only / activity-only copy, body builder, routing).

## Task 4: UI Spacing & Anti-Saturation Polish
- `lib/core/theme/app_theme.dart` — added `AppSpacing.section` (32) and
  `AppSpacing.pageBottom` (48).
- `schedule_page.dart`, `routines_page.dart`, `nutrition_page.dart` — top-level
  section gaps raised to `AppSpacing.section` and a `pageBottom` breathing-room
  inset added so the last card never hugs the navigation bar.
- Test: the calendar spacing assertion in
  `m45_calendar_symptoms_widget_test.dart`.

